              <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-mcgennis-gold bg-opacity-10 text-mcgennis-gold text-xs font-semibold rounded-full">
                Blog Series
              </span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight group-hover:text-mcgennis-gold transition-colors mb-3">
              View All From Scratch Fridays
            </h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4 font-light">
              See all our From Scratch Friday adventures as we cook, create, and learn together as a family.
            </p>
            <div class="flex items-center text-mcgennis-gold font-medium group-hover:text-mcgennis-maroon transition-colors">
              See All Posts
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 ml-2 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"/>
